      "statement": "DUS-07 defines Restricted - Client Confidential as account-level activity in deposit systems, financial-crimes features, or account data used for risk purposes, which is a narrower/more sensitive category than Confidential - Client (a client's own transactions, wire history, beneficiaries).",
